  "caption": "Late-night chill R&B slow jam, neo-soul ballad, sparse minimal drums with soft deep 808 kick and warm sub bass, gentle finger snaps, warm Rhodes electric piano with lush maj7 and m7 chords, airy ambient pads, intimate breathy male lead vocal with soft falsetto in the chorus, clear English diction, lush reverb, spacious dreamy mix, night flight above the clouds, melancholic but hopeful, emotional build into the final chorus",
